              <aside class="solutions-tab-aside"><figure><img src="/assets/img/program-coaching.jpg" alt="Sesión de coaching organizacional"><figcaption>Conversar para avanzar</figcaption></figure><a href="/coaching-organizacional">Ver Coaching <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></aside>
            </article>
